I just saw a sign advertising computers that ran like "greased
lightning", and both of those terms triggered my Nethack mentality. So
why not have a reference to that in Nethack?

Greasing your wand of lightning could give it a 33% chance of hitting
monsters in its path several times with each bolt, and a 50% chance of
the grease wearing off.

"The bolt moves like greased lightning! The mumak is hit! -more-
"The mumak is hit! The bolt of lightning bounces! -more-
"The mumak is hit! The mumak is hit! You kill the mumak! -more-
"Welcome to level 11.  Your wand is no longer as oily."

Furthermore, eating a greased wand of lightning as a metallivore will
have a chance of providing intrinsic speed.

"The greased wand of lightning is delicious! You feel yourself moving
faster."



